         <t:abstract>
            <t:p>This hymn is ascribed to John Chrysostom. The hymn itself begins with <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">ተፈሥሒ፡ ኦእግዝእትነ፡ ማርያም፡</t:foreign>, which is repeated after each stanza.
            In most manuscripts it is preceded by a preamble varying in structure and length, which begins with <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">እሰግድ፡ ለኪ፡ ወእዌድሰኪ፡ ኦእግዝእትየ፡ ማርያም፡</t:foreign>.</t:p>
         </t:abstract>
